  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- Reduce child mortality due to malaria in Senegal. 2- Prevent malaria from becoming severe by providing the necessary medicines for treatment. 3- Support global efforts to eliminate the malaria epidemic in the most needy countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decrease in deaths of children, pregnant women and adults due to malaria epidemic</narrative>
